From d1a752fbb21891ee87fbdf1d5d17a80da34cb5df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Benjamin Tan <benjamin@dev.ofcr.se>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0300
Subject: cli: git: add raw ref fetch command

Reviewers often need commits from forge refs such as
`refs/pull/123/head`

Add `jj git ref fetch` for raw refs or full commit IDs from a named
remote. The command reports the imported commits and leaves them visible
without bookmarks, remote-tracking refs, or durable raw ref names

Use the fetch configuration only when it matches one remote. Require
`--remote` when it matches more than one remote

Refs #4388

Co-authored-by: 4evy <git@evy.pink>

